@startuml cu53
!theme plain
title CU53 — Buscar Presupuesto

actor "Receptionist (Recepcionista)" as Actor
participant "Notaire system" as System

Actor -> Actor : The receptionist (Recepcionista) or clerk (Gestor) needs a budget.
System -> System : Receptionist
Actor -> Actor : Requests: (Budget number; First and last name; Identification type and number)
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The receptionist (Recepcionista) or clerk (Gestor) enters the data.
System -> System : Receptionist
Actor -> Actor : Looks up and returns the budget or budgets.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The receptionist (Recepcionista) or clerk (Gestor) selects a budget.
System -> System : Receptionist
Actor -> Actor : Presents a budget report.
System -> System : System

@enduml